Retrieve a specific configuration setting by key (e.g. 'server.url', 'defaults.scope').

Usage:
  orbit config get <key> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for get
      --json   Print the result as a JSON envelope
      --raw    Print the value as stored, without formatting; secret values are shown in plaintext

Global Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to configuration file
